# landmark (assets/world3d/goose-green/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Sir Honks-a-Lot Picnic Green: the great goose in stone and plaster beside the north gate, topiary behind the long hedge, the marquee raised into a tall striped pavilion.
# the goose statue on its plinth: body, tail, neck, head and beak
box    stone   at 236 0 8 size 34 18 16
sphere plaster at 236 18 8 size 38 24 15
wedge  plaster at 216 28 8 size 14 10 10
cylinder-8 plaster at 248 38 8 size 10 28 10
sphere plaster at 250 64 8 size 16 12 12
wedge  wood    at 260 68 8 size 10 4 6 turn -90
# topiary behind the long hedge
sphere hedge   at 258 0 8 size 26 56 16
cone-8 hedge   at 290 0 8 size 24 68 16
sphere hedge   at 322 0 8 size 26 52 16
# the marquee: a centre mast, a tall striped roof, a pole and pennant
box    wood    at 88 0 48 size 3 38 3
pyramid cloth  at 88 38 48 size 88 22 36
box    wood    at 88 60 48 size 3 14 3
wedge  cloth   at 88 66 48 size 16 8 2
